    "turn_idx": 4,
    "turn_text": "It's amazing. And the way you frame that you couldn't have imagined a year and a half ago being in the list, all those many things happening at once, all against the backdrop of this pandemic. And I want to just ask you about that as well. How do you see the connection between what happened on January 6th and the broader disaster that we've been living through at this COVID-19 pandemic?",
