    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/6/76922.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 20,
    "turn_text": "Those points are all, I couldn't agree with you more. I don't think I've heard anybody say the second one as clearly as you just said it. In terms of what was possible, I think a lot of Americans have forgotten what's possible under disaster conditions. And we've never really faced, maybe back to World War II, that we've had a national disaster of this",
