  {
    "episode_id": 76922,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/6/76922.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 28,
    "turn_text": "I'm glad that you brought up this issue of the divergence in trust in government and trust in science, and I think it's a pretty fluid dynamic. I'm hopeful like you that with better science, communication, leadership going into this year, people can learn to trust again. I want to ask you something about your background and something else that's important. I think you bring to this conversation is your background in the military. in terms of problem solving, and also in terms of sort of learning from disasters. This is a huge problem in the United States, learning from disasters, and then turning those lessons into better ways to do things. I'm sure that's something that you must learn as an officer.",
